[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114377557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710#issuecomment-4114377557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117710","id":4114377557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71PGtV","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T23:29:12Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T23:29:12Z","body":"Should be ready for review now. Note however, that this PR is stacked on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114598 so this one needs to be reviewed first.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4114377557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4121392158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710#issuecomment-4121392158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117710","id":4121392158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71p3Qe","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T21:12:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T21:12:18Z","body":"Tested for some time with VS Code. It works well, and makes working with string auto-completions much smoother.\r\n\r\nThe only cases I've found where it's still tripping me up is when trying to auto-completing an unterminated string literal.\r\n\r\n#### Example 1 (| represents caret):\r\n```gdscript\r\nif Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_|):\r\n```\r\nSelecting a completion option here results in:\r\n```gdscript\r\nif Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"\"ui_accept\"):\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Example 2:\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar input_dir := Input.get_vector(\"move_|, \"move_right\", \"move_forward\", \"move_back\")\r\n```\r\nSelecting a completion option here results in:\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar input_dir := Input.get_vector(\"move_left\"move_right\", \"move_forward\", \"move_back\")\r\n```` \r\nwhen I wanted;\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar input_dir := Input.get_vector(\"move_left\", \"move_right\", \"move_forward\", \"move_back\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nExample 2 I suppose is technically correct, because it's just replacing the string literal the caret is currently inside, but it's not what I _want_ in that scenario. The behaviour in example 1 doesn't really seem right at all.\r\n\r\nI ended up in these scenarios by typing or inserting a string, realizing I made a mistake, backspacing once and then triggering auto-complete again. I imagine if you have _Auto Closing Quotes_ disabled in the editor that would cause similar issues.\r\n\r\nIt's an edge case, maybe not an important drawback, but Godot's builtin script editor actually _does_ handle both of these examples the way I expect. I'm not sure how exactly the behaviour is specified -- seems to be something like replace the text from the opening quote up to the first word boundary at or after the caret? (in example 2, putting the caret after the underscore instead gives a different result in the built-in editor).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4121392158/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124872451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710#issuecomment-4124872451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117710","id":4124872451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc713I8D","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T09:00:35Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T09:00:35Z","body":"> The only cases I've found where it's still tripping me up is when trying to auto-completing an unterminated string literal.\r\n\r\nFor simplicity this PR uses the GDScript parsers string literal parsing. To solve this issue we would need to roll some custom island parser for string literals that is more resilient to errors. Might be worth it in the future, but I'd not add it to this initial implementation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124872451/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4147896731","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710#issuecomment-4147896731","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117710","id":4147896731,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73O-Gb","user":{"login":"NathanLovato","id":12694995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk0OTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12694995?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanLovato","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-28T11:30:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T11:31:02Z","body":"I've compiled and tested this with the Zed GDScript extension. It's working well for me, I don't have any issues to report besides the limitation mentioned above. It improves the autocomplete experience.\r\n\r\nIn Zed the default behavior for automatic autocomplete suggestions in this context is constrained; it mainly triggers after inputting double quotes, e.g. when the text is looking like this: `Input.get_vector(\"|\")`.\r\n\r\nTo trigger this case, `if Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"ui_|):`, I actually have to delete a quote and manually bring up autocomplete with Ctrl+Space (that's with the default configuration for auto-closing and surrounding with character pairs).\r\n\r\nThanks much!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4147896731/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187699249","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710#issuecomment-4187699249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117710","id":4